error[E0518]: accessors require a field, but 'area' is a function
 --> $DIR/not-a-field.nra:4:9
  |
3 |     export let area = func -> int => 4;
  |                ---- 'area' is declared here
4 |         | get: 4;
  |         ^^^^^^^^^ accessor clause on a function
  |
  = help: remove the clause; only an exported instance field can have 'get' and 'set' accessors

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0518`.
